      <title>为什么在高维度空间中距离失效</title>
      <link>https://918822019.github.io/?doc=docs%2FRAG%2Fembedding%2F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E5%9C%A8%E9%AB%98%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%AD%E8%B7%9D%E7%A6%BB%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88.md</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://918822019.github.io/?doc=docs%2FRAG%2Fembedding%2F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E5%9C%A8%E9%AB%98%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%AD%E8%B7%9D%E7%A6%BB%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88.md</guid>
      <description>核心结论：有效信息通常位于低维流形，而常用距离在整个高维空间计算，噪声和无关维度会掩盖有用信号，导致距离失去区分力。</description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
